 SOTA-ingestion (exp4238) flagged that 'explicit summary features were not
 enough' and named the next lever: a TRUE permutation-invariant candidate-SET
 encoder with inter-candidate attention over all grids and vote basins
 (Set-Encoder 2404.06912; MSV 2603.03417 cross-sequence). Train a
 DeepSets/attention set-encoder that scores each candidate CONDITIONED on the
 full per-task candidate set, with the calibrated imbalance-aware loss
 (2509.19681: class-weighted/focal + stratified-balanced minibatches +
 temperature/isotonic calibration), OUT-OF-FOLD (held-out-task split),
 verifier_is_oracle=false. ABLATE against the .392 augmented-logistic
 aggregator on the SAME split. Report off-fold AUROC (set-encoder vs
 augmented-logistic) + aggregator_trained + learned_verifier_path. Honest
 no-gain-over-logistic is COMPLETE and still feeds A3.

